---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service — Orbit Web Designs & Marketing" description="Orbit Web Designs & Marketing Terms of Service — governing your use of our website and services.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">By accessing orbitwebdesigns.co.ke, you agree to these Terms. If you disagree, do not use the site.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. Services</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">We provide web design, e-commerce, automation, and digital marketing services. Specific deliverables, timelines, and pricing are defined in individual project agreements.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Client Responsibilities</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Provide accurate content, assets, and credentials in a timely manner</li>
          <li>Own or have rights to all content provided</li>
          <li>Provide valid Daraja credentials for M-Pesa integration (if applicable)</li>
          <li>Respond to approval requests within 3 business days</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Payment Terms</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>50% deposit to begin, 50% on launch (or per agreed milestones)</li>
          <li>Payments in KES, USD, or EUR via M-Pesa, card, or PayPal</li>
          <li>Late payments may delay launch</li>
          <li>No refunds after project commencement (work performed)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Final deliverables: client owns all rights upon full payment</li>
          <li>We retain rights to use project in portfolio (unless NDA signed)</li>
          <li>Third-party assets (fonts, images, plugins) subject to their licenses</li>
          <li>Client responsible for content legality</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. Warranties & Disclaimers</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>We warrant work meets agreed specs for 30 days post-launch</li>
          <li>No guarantee of specific business results (traffic, sales, rankings)</li>
          <li>Third-party services (M-Pesa, hosting, APIs) subject to their uptime</li>
          <li>Site provided "as is" — no warranty of uninterrupted access</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Our liability limited to fees paid. Not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages. Force majeure events excuse performance.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">6. Termination</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Either party may terminate with 7 days written notice. Client pays for work completed to date.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">7. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Governed by laws of Kenya. Disputes resolved in Nairobi courts.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">8. Changes</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">We may update these terms. Continued use constitutes acceptance.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:mwmwai@gmail.com" class="text-electric hover:underline">mwmwai@gmail.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/254741992308" class="text-electric hover:underline">0741 992 308</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>